sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Main
    participant Create as createAccount
    participant State as accounts array
    User->>Main: Select option 1
    Main->>Create: Call function
    Create->>Create: Check count below 100
    Create->>User: Prompt number, name, balance
    User-->>Create: Enter values
    Create->>State: Store structure at next index
    Create->>Create: Increment accountCount
    Create-->>Main: Return to menu
